<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Improve safety" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Improve safety</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Safeguard systems and personnel, minimize risks, and maintain stable performance. Gain peace of mind with well-protected infrastructure.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Operate easily" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Operate easily</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Handle devices and software with ease using our intuitive, user-friendly design. Streamline your workflows and reduce training time for your team to manage processes efficiently.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Increase availability" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Increase availability</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Deliver high system availability in tough conditions with conformal coating. Implement NERC CIP and BDEW compliant cybersecurity to protect your assets.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='3EUGcqJ5goGaFA3VLYyVz6' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='3EUGcqJ5goGaFA3VLYyVz6'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-3EUGcqJ5goGaFA3VLYyVz6" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="3EUGcqJ5goGaFA3VLYyVz6" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-3EUGcqJ5goGaFA3VLYyVz6"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Included inputs and outputs" id="G_Included%20inputs%20and%20outputs-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Included%20inputs%20and%20outputs-0-title" aria-describedby="G_Included%20inputs%20and%20outputs-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Included%20inputs%20and%20outputs-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Included inputs and outputs</h3><div id="G_Included%20inputs%20and%20outputs-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>The SIPROTEC 7SL86 includes 12 predefined standard variants with 4/4 or 8/8 current transformers / voltage transformers, 5 to 31 binary inputs and 8 to 46 binary outputs.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Protection functions" id="G_Protection%20functions-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Protection%20functions-1-title" aria-describedby="G_Protection%20functions-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Protection%20functions-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Protection functions</h3><div id="G_Protection%20functions-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Ensure rapid fault clearance with a 9 ms tripping time and stable, sensitive adaptive differential protection, despite transformer errors or CT saturation. Select distance protection for flexible backup or main protection.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Communication and data sharing" id="G_Communication%20and%20data%20sharing-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Communication%20and%20data%20sharing-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Communication%20and%20data%20sharing-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Communication%20and%20data%20sharing-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Communication and data sharing</h3><div id="G_Communication%20and%20data%20sharing-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Use up to four pluggable modules for IEC 61850 and Modbus TCP protocols. Use virtual network sharing and serial data over various media. Benefit from automatic switchover and PRP/HSR for reliable data transmission.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="CardsContainer" props-url="/props/3EUGcqJ5goGaFA3VLYyVz6-en-US.json" page-id="6udIo9wehArVYW2axfvtjE" container="comp-3EUGcqJ5goGaFA3VLYyVz6"></disw-hydrate></template></div></is-lan